WEBVTT

00:03:58.234 --> 00:04:01.279
I could advocate
for a well-equipped library.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.407
With this, we would have enough
textbooks in the library,

00:04:04.448 --> 00:04:07.451
and children would have enough
reading materials.

00:04:07.451 --> 00:04:10.663
They would do it at school
in performing in the national exams.

00:04:10.705 --> 00:04:13.499
However, I had one issue with the library.

00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:16.627
You see, food can be scarce
in the refugee camp,

00:04:16.669 --> 00:04:19.005
and several times
when I showed up at school,

00:04:19.046 --> 00:04:22.133
I personally remembered every time
I entered in the library,

00:04:22.174 --> 00:04:24.010
all I could think about was food.

00:04:24.927 --> 00:04:28.306
More than anything, I needed
a solution that was cheap,

00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:29.765
a solution that was credible,

00:04:29.765 --> 00:04:33.144
and something that would be
very exciting to the children.